	"description": "Fast, fully offline image description and an accessible overlay for windows NVDA cannot read. Everything runs on your own computer. Images are never sent to the internet.\nNVDA+Alt+A: describe the current element\nNVDA+Alt+W: describe the current window\nNVDA+Alt+F: describe the whole screen\nNVDA+Alt+D: describe the clipboard image\nPress twice for a detailed description in a window, where you can ask questions about the image.\nNVDA+Alt+O: the overlay, a list of a window's texts and icons; Enter clicks an item\nNVDA+Alt+G: automatic descriptions of images without a label, on or off\nNVDA+Alt+B: names for buttons without a name, on or off\nNVDA+Alt+N: give your own name to a button or overlay item",
